/P 419 0 R
/E (A practical rule of thumb in our agency is to limit each agent to four to six tools. Overloading an agent with too many tools can lead to hallucinations or confusion about which tool to use and in what order. If you notice performance issues, consider splitting the functionality across multiple agents to maintain clarity and reliability. During my training you will see how keeping the number of Tools can give you a clear workflow.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
