/T (While model costs often make headlines, our experience has taught us that they are a minor consideration when the ROI is significant. If an AI agent delivers a tremendous return on investment compared to manual processes, the cost of the model becomes negligible. Focus on value creation, and the costs will naturally be justified by the substantial savings and efficiencies gained. I build my entire OpenAI Swarm and CrewAI Training with less $20 API costs of OpenAI. )
