/E (LLMs are prone to hallucinations or providing outdated, non- transparent information. To counter this, incorporate Retrieval Augmented Generation \(RAG\). With RAG, the LLM retrieves relevant pieces and snippets from documents \(using semantic similarity and techniques such as embedding and chunking\), augments the retrieved data for improved quality, and then generates an accurate response. This method not only enhances transparency and accuracy but also secures your internal documents by keeping sensitive information off the public internet. Buildng a good RAG pipeline and ts fundemental is part of My training: AI Agents Mastery - Complete.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
