/E (Ignoring text-to-speech capabilities means missing out on adding a human-like touch to your AI agents. Integrating TTS not only enhances the interactive experience but also serves as a finishing touch that makes your application feel complete. Platforms like ElevenLabs are highly regarded, and there are also open-source alternatives \(such as PlayIT or Coco TTS from Hugging Face\) that support multiple languages. Adding TTS functionality can significantly improve the usability and appeal of your AI solution. For building TTS AI Agents in a few minutes Watch this Free Tutorial.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [1 2]
