/T (Pydantic AI Simplifies Building AI agents)
/E (Pydantic AI Simplifies Building AI agents)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
790 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 452 0 R
/E (Pydantic AI simplifies building AI agents by using structured data classes, making input/output management and dependency handling straightforward. It seamlessly integrates multiple search engines like DuckDuckGo and Tavily, and supports asynchronous queries for faster, concurrent searches. Agents dynamically adapt the search depth and formatting of outputs based on flexible system prompts, allowing real-time injection of variables such as dates to ensure relevant and timely results. Structured outputs enable precise formatting of responses into useful components, such as markdown summaries and bullet points, improving clarity and usability. Providing examples in ready-to-use notebooks further accelerates experimentation and customization, facilitating immediate hands-on exploration without complicated setups. Both Langchain and Pydantic AI use Pydantic approach.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [8 9 10]
>>
endobj
